{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前下がりボブ\nわりと好評でよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいっぱいありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずさいきんの握手会のおはなし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き\nHoney Cinnamon\nのくまパーカー着ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型なんで隠すん！と突っ込まれた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってくまパーカーきたかったんだもん！\nすごくお気に入り～かわいい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後＝Honey Cinnamon\nてくらいきてる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポップティーンでも\nハニーシナモン着ること多い✩✩(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号でも着てるよ！！！\nぜひポップティーンチェックしてみて～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとねー\n握手会みんな\n髪型似合ってる～\nゆってくれてすごい嬉しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型でも\nいろんなヘアアレンジやってきたいな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n13まいめの握手が\n川後全完売したらしいです(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますほんと(;o;)\n感謝でしかない、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが\nハッピーになれる握手できるように\nがんばるね((o(｡･ω･｡)o))♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しもうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいきん寒いから\nあったかい飲み物をよく飲むよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなはココア派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは\nあったかい飲み物は何が好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ、\nあったかくしてねてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/11/12/4010989/0009.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}